SUMMARY:Miller Architecture Program Virtual Info Session: Application Por
 tfolio Tips
DESCRIPTION:Today's 60-minute Virtual Information Session will offer guid
 ance regarding your application portfolio. Bring your questions to the co
 nversation.  The J. Irwin Miller Master of Architecture program is a thre
 e-year in-residence program\, with a two-year advanced placement track po
 ssible for students who hold a B.Arch from a NAAB-accredited institution 
 or regional equivalent. With our twin studios approach\, students take vi
 sual art course alongside architectural studios to develop their style of
  architectural design. The three-year program welcome applicants from a v
 ariety of educational and career backgrounds.
