 le><p>          &#160\;        </p></td></tr><tr><td colspan="2"><p style
 ="text-align: center\;">          &#160\;        </p><p style="text-align
 : center\;"><strong><em>By Their Own Hands: The Black Filmmakers Hall of 
 Fame!</em></strong></p><p>          Founded in 1974 by the Culture and Et
 hnic Affairs Guild of the Oakland Museum of California\, the Black Filmma
 kers Hall of Fame began as a film lecture series and awards ceremony cele
 brating achievements of Black film industry figures. When that organizati
 on closed\, they donated their materials to IU. In collaboration with the
  IU Black Film Center and Archive\, this exhibit features objects from th
 at collection\, including founding documents\, costumes\, and handprints 
 of inductees to the Hall of Fame.        </p><p style="text-align: center
 \;"><strong>Dates: September 2025 - December 2026</strong></p><p>        
   &#160\;        </p><picture class="lw_image lw_image28163  lw_align_cen
