 ></tr><tr><td style="width: 99.9123%\;" colspan="2"><p style="text-align:
  center\;">          &#160\;        </p><p style="text-align: center\;"><
 strong><em>Capturing the Campus: T.C. Steele\, Indiana University's First
  Artist in Residence</em></strong></p><p><em>Capturing the Campus</em> pa
 ys tribute to renowned Hoosier artist T.C. Steele. The exhibit honors the
  century that has passed since his death by showcasing paintings form the
  artist's residency at IU and other relevant works. The exhibit will brin
 g together Steele's landscapes from the IU Public Art and Cultural Herita
 ge Collection and the Indiana State Museum and Historic Sites' collection
 \, allowing the holdings of these two collections to be viewed in one spa
 ce.        </p><p style="text-align: center\;"><strong>Dates: April 17\, 
 2026 - April 2026</strong></p><p><picture class="lw_image lw_image30589  
 lw_align_left"><source media="(max-width: 500px)" type="image/webp" srcse
