SUMMARY:Parents' Night In at the Eskenazi Museum of Art
DESCRIPTION:Parents' Night In offers a unique opportunity to enjoy the mu
 seum with separate but parallel programming for kids and adults that supp
 orts connection\, creativity\, and relaxation.K-12 Children's Program: Gu
 ided gallery exploration\, hands-on art activity in the art studio + snac
 k.Adult Program: Choose your own adventure! Wander the galleries with a s
 elf-guided activity for connection or join the guided tour. Enjoy art-mak
 ing in the 2nd floor atrium and a sweet treat and tea.Know Before You Go:
  Read about where to find us\, where to park\, accessibility\, and museum
  guidelines.When You Arrive:If you parked in the IMU parking lot\, Guest 
 Services can validate your parking voucher for a 40% discount.  Head upst
 airs to the 2nd Floor and into the Simpson Center for Education to start.
   When in the galleries\, do not touch the artwork. Be mindful to keep bo
 dy parts and anything you're carrying at least 18" away from the art.  Ph
 otography is welcome! Just no flash or selfie sticks.
X-ALT-DESC;FMTTYPE=text/html:<p><em>Parents' Night In</em> offers a uniqu
 e opportunity to enjoy the museum with separate but parallel programming 
 for kids and adults that supports connection\, creativity\, and relaxatio
 n.</p><p><strong>K-12 Children's Program:</strong> Guided gallery explora
 tion\, hands-on art activity in the art studio + snack.</p><p><strong>Adu
 lt Program:</strong> Choose your own adventure! Wander the galleries with
  a self-guided activity for connection or join the guided tour. Enjoy art
 -making in the 2nd floor atrium and a sweet treat and tea.</p><p><strong>
