SUMMARY:Spring 2027 Experiential Learning Scholarship Application Deadline
DESCRIPTION:The Walter Center is excited to offer experiential learning s
 cholarships to College of Arts and Sciences students! These funds help de
 fray the cost of travel\, housing\, and other expenses during an experien
 tial learning opportunity. By completing the application\, you will be co
 nsidered for each scholarship the Walter Center has to offer.The applicat
 ion for Spring 2027 Experiential Learning scholarships closes on Sunday\,
  November 22.&#160\;Learn More + Apply (https://careers.college.indiana.e
 du/work-experience/experiential-learning-scholarships/index.html)
X-ALT-DESC;FMTTYPE=text/html:<p>  The Walter Center is excited to offer e
 xperiential learning scholarships to College of Arts and Sciences student
 s! These funds help defray the cost of travel\, housing\, and other expen
 ses during an experiential learning opportunity. By completing the applic
 ation\, you will be considered for each scholarship the Walter Center has
  to offer.</p><p><strong>The application for Spring 2027 Experiential Lea
 rning scholarships closes on Sunday\, November 22.&#160\;</strong></p><p>
 <a href="https://careers.college.indiana.edu/work-experience/experiential
 -learning-scholarships/index.html">Learn More + Apply</a></p>
